{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2JN","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"約翰二書","commonName":"約翰二書","title":"約翰二書","order":63,"numberOfChapters":1,"sha256":"0f5804e2610c3b4fa34275f6d710a7b531ce83efaa4a2aab440a82e78f181de4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2JN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":1,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2JN/1.json","totalNumberOfVerses":13},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我這作長老的寫信給蒙揀選的女士",{"noteId":0},"和你的兒女，就是我本著真理所愛的。不但我愛你們，一切認識真理的人也都愛你們，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["這是因為真理在我們裡面，並且永遠與我們同在。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["父上帝和祂兒子耶穌基督的恩典、憐憫和平安，必在真理和愛中與我們同在！"]},{"type":"heading","content":["彼此相愛"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我看見你一些兒女按照我們從父領受的命令遵行真理，感到非常欣慰。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["女士啊，我現在勸你，我們要彼此相愛。這不是新命令，而是我們從起初就已經領受的命令。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["愛就是遵行上帝的命令。你們要活出愛，這是你們從起初就聽到的命令。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["提防騙子"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["因為許多騙子已經來到世上，他們否認耶穌基督曾降世為人。這樣的人是騙子，是敵基督者。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["你們要謹慎，好得到完滿的賞賜，免得我們前功盡棄。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["凡偏離基督教導的人，都沒有上帝；凡遵守基督教導的人，都有父和子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["若有人到你們那裡不傳基督的教導，不要請他到家裡，也不要問候他，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["因為問候他就是與他同流合污。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["結語"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我還有許多事要告訴你們，但不想藉助紙墨，只希望到你們那裡當面暢談，使我們喜樂滿溢。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["你那蒙揀選之姊妹的兒女問候你。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"學者一般認為「蒙揀選的女士」是指教會。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":1}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2JN/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/3JN/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1JN/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}